# Terraform
# NOTE: this used to ignore the whole terraform/ directory, which meant
# every .tf file (security groups, S3 policy, DNS module, go-live/go-idle
# scripts) had zero commit history and existed only on one laptop — see
# the sync audit doc for why that made a real production incident much
# harder to diagnose than it needed to be. Only the generated/sensitive
# artifacts are ignored now; the actual Terraform source is committed.
terraform/**/.terraform/
terraform/**/*.tfstate
terraform/**/*.tfstate.*
terraform/scripts/setup-ssm.sh
.env

# Load Testing
load-testing/


# Agents
.agent/*